\unset ECHO
1|content json|b
2|content json|<ul><li>Yehuda Katz</li><li>Carl Lerche</li><li>Alan Johnson</li></ul>
3|an empty template renders empty, not whatever follows it in memory|[]
4|an empty template writes an empty file|t
5|empty template file size|0
6|an empty string value renders empty, not whatever follows it in the jsonb|[]
7|same, unescaped|[]
8|same, as an array element|[<><XYZ>]
9|same, as a partial from the data|[]
10|an empty key renders empty under object iteration|[<=v><b=XYZ>]
11|an empty string as the last thing in the jsonb renders empty|[]
